      "content": "you don't get it... there is no hospital. there is no shelter. we are in the middle of a war zone. calling someone won't stop the walls from coming down or the soldiers from breaking in. it's all just... pointless. i think about how much more dignity there would be if it just ended on our terms, instead of letting them do whatever they want to us when they break in. do you think there's any honor in just choosing to go quietly?",
